source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A backslash written as a character reference does not join the run in front of the closer, so the closer consumes the raw backslash alone and the body keeps the referenced one.
-- input.jira --
{{a&#92;\}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a&#92;</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\`
-- warnings.json --
[]
